  "description": "Don’t want to charge every day—and don’t want a bumpy ride either? The Hiboy MAX Pro is built for real-life use: daily commutes + weekend rides. One charge lets you go farther with less range anxiety, whether you’re heading to work, running errands, doing school drop-offs, or cruising by the river.\nLess-than-perfect roads? No problem. The 11-inch pneumatic tires smooth out small bumps for a steadier, more comfortable ride. It accelerates confidently, handles hills with ease, and reaches up to 22 MPH to keep your day moving.\nA wide deck keeps your stance comfortable, while the sturdy build and dual braking give you more control when traffic gets unpredictable. If you want an e-scooter that’s long-range, stable, and easy to ride every day, the MAX Pro is a solid pick.",
